@startuml

title PENA-Agent — Domain Model

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam class {
  BorderColor #2F5597
  BackgroundColor #F8FBFF
  ArrowColor #444444
}

class UserContext {
  +userId
  +interests
  +expertiseAreas
  +preferences
  +trustPreferences
}

class Source {
  +sourceId
  +name
  +url
  +category
  +trustLevel
}

class Article {
  +articleId
  +title
  +content
  +publicationDate
  +author
}

class Summary {
  +summaryId
  +summaryText
  +modelUsed
  +generationDate
}

class Digest {
  +digestId
  +creationDate
  +topic
}

class TrustSignal {
  +signalType
  +score
  +reason
}

class RelevanceScore {
  +score
  +reasoning
}

class Observation {
  +observationId
  +timestamp
  +eventType
  +details
}

class LearningArtifact {
  +artifactId
  +lesson
  +confidenceLevel
}

UserContext --> Digest : personalizes
Digest --> Article : contains
Article --> Source : originates from
Article --> Summary : summarized as
Article --> TrustSignal : evaluated by
Article --> RelevanceScore : ranked by

Observation --> Digest : observes
Observation --> Article : tracks
LearningArtifact --> Observation : extracted from

note bottom of UserContext
Context is treated as:
- active semantic memory
- personalization substrate
- AI grounding context
end note

note right of LearningArtifact
Learning artifacts represent:
- reusable insights
- validated patterns
- SDLC2 knowledge accumulation
end note

@enduml
